SUMMARY:Machine Dazzle: Changes
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:The Costume Design for Taylor Mac’s A 24-Decade History of Po
 pular Music\nMachine Dazzle has been creating extraordinary costumes for o
 ver 30 years. As an artist\, costume designer\, set designer\, and perform
 ance artist\, he has presented his genre-defying work at venues ranging fr
 om Broadway to the runway\, wowing audiences from Joe’s Pub to the Museu
 m of Arts and Design in New York. As the nation marks 250 years of America
 ’s history\, MASS MoCA will showcase wearable sculptural looks by the ar
 tist that examine the 24 decades since the founding of the United States i
 n 1776.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/machine-dazzle-changes-the-costume-des
 ign-for-taylor-macs-a-24-decade-history-of-popular-music/\nFrom Pushpin We
 stern Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/machine-dazzle-changes-the-costume-design-fo
 r-taylor-macs-a-24-decade-history-of-popular-music/
